claim.claim-text:
providing a fluid conduit;
releasing the fluid conduit by moving the valve member to the valve closed position and then moving the or each retention member to the release position;
retaining the fluid conduit by moving the or each retention member to the retention position and then moving the valve member to the valve open position;
using the blank to engage the or each retention member so as to maintain the or each retention member in the release position; and
removing the blank from the or each retention member so as to permit movement of the or each retention member from the release position.
